  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/958291/description_31da0c1a-3425-4a56-b9ff-8795113b90fd.png\" alt=\"木箱樂 (Crate Delight)\"></p><p><strong>使用木箱和袋子擴展你的儲存空間，讓物品收納更有條理！</strong> 木箱樂讓你可以製作各式木箱和袋子，以時尚的方式整理資源，告別雜亂的箱子，讓背包井然有序。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-forge/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=26.1&amp;showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下載 26.1 更新\"></a><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KXy6vrX.png\" alt=\"Fabric 版本下載\"></p><h2>🍎 功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>木箱：</strong>可儲存蘋果、甜莓、雞蛋、生鮭魚、生鱈魚、螢光莓果、金蘋果等眾多物品！</li>\n<li><strong>袋子：</strong>適用於可可豆、糖、火藥等物品。</li>\n</ul><h2>🛠️ 擴充套件</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-croptopia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">木箱樂：Croptopia</a>&nbsp;\n<ul>\n<li>為 Croptopia 模組新增超過 50 種木箱和袋子。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"為購買筆電儲款中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我按鈕\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐款按鈕\"></a></p>",
